  "bodyHTML": "<div class=\"civil-war-table-wrap\"><table class=\"civil-war-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Date</th><th scope=\"col\">Battle</th><th scope=\"col\">State</th><th scope=\"col\">Result</th><th scope=\"col\">Class</th><th scope=\"col\">Notes</th><th scope=\"col\">Commentary</th><th scope=\"col\">Manual Supplement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-paragraph=\"1\" data-entry-id=\"1\"><td data-label=\"Date\">April 12 –13, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Fort_Sumter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Fort Sumter</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">South Carolina</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Confederate</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC A</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Beauregard takes Charleston Federal fort in the first battle of the American Civil War .</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\">萨姆特堡战役发生于1861年4月12日至13日，是美国南北战争的开端。南方邦联军队在南卡罗来纳州查尔斯顿港向坚守的联邦军要塞开炮，持续轰炸34小时后逼降守军。此战正式拉开四年内战的序幕，促使林肯总统号召志愿军参战。基本概况时间：1861年4月12日 — 4月13日地点：南卡罗来纳州查尔斯顿港萨姆特堡交战双方：南方邦联军（皮埃尔·博雷加德指挥）对阵北方联邦军（罗伯特·安德森少校指挥）人员伤亡：战斗期间双方均无人员直接阵亡战役过程冲突起因：南方多州宣布脱离联邦并成立邦联，但南卡罗来纳州查尔斯顿港的萨姆特堡仍由联邦军（北军）驻守。打响第一枪：1861年4月12日凌晨4点30分，南方邦联军向萨姆特堡开火，展开持续34小时的猛烈炮击。结果结局：北军弹药将尽、寡不敌众，安德森少校被迫宣布投降并撤出要塞。历史影响内战爆发：标志着美国南北战争全面爆发。局势升级：促使北方民意彻底沸腾，林肯随即向北方发布战争动员令，招募7.5万名志愿军。立场分裂：更多中间骑墙的蓄奴州在战后选择加入南方邦联，彻底断绝了和平解决的可能。</td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\">萨姆特堡战役<br><br>https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%90%A8%E5%A7%86%E7%89%B9%E5%A0%A1%E6%88%98%E5%BD%B9/10060457</td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"2\" data-entry-id=\"2\"><td data-label=\"Date\">May 18 –19, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Sewell's_Point\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Sewell's Point</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">Virginia</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Inconclusive</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC D</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Union gunboats fight inconclusive battle with Confederate artillery.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"3\" data-entry-id=\"3\"><td data-label=\"Date\">May 29 – June 1, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Aquia_Creek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Aquia Creek</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">Virginia</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Inconclusive</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC D</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Confederate artillery hit by naval bombardment, later withdrawn.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"4\" data-entry-id=\"4\"><td data-label=\"Date\">June 3, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Philippi_(West_Virginia)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Philippi (West Virginia)</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">West Virginia (Virginia at the time) [ A ]</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Union</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC D</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Union forces rout a small Confederate detachment in Western Virginia.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"5\" data-entry-id=\"5\"><td data-label=\"Date\">June 10, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Big_Bethel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Big Bethel</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">Virginia</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Confederate</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC C</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Union attack on Confederate positions near a church repelled.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"6\" data-entry-id=\"6\"><td data-label=\"Date\">June 17, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Boonville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Boonville (Missouri)</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">Missouri</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Union</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC C</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Union forces defeat pro-Confederate governor's Missouri State Guard.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"7\" data-entry-id=\"7\"><td data-label=\"Date\">July 2, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Hoke's_Run\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Hoke's Run</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">West Virginia (Virginia at the time) [ A ]</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Union</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC D</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Robert Patterson defeats Jackson's Confederates but fails to capitalize on his victory.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"8\" data-entry-id=\"8\"><td data-label=\"Date\">July 5, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Carthage_(1861)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Carthage</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">Missouri</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Confederate</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC C</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Confederate victory in Missouri during U.S. Civil War.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"9\" data-entry-id=\"9\"><td data-label=\"Date\">July 11, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Rich_Mountain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Rich Mountain</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">West Virginia (Virginia at the time) [ A ]</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Union</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC B</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Confederate forces under Gen. Robert S. Garnett split in half mid-battle by Union forces under Maj. Gen. George B. McClellan . One half surrenders; the other escapes.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"10\" data-entry-id=\"10\"><td data-label=\"Date\">July 18, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Blackburn's_Ford\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Blackburn's Ford</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">Virginia</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Confederate</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC C</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Irvin McDowell 's recon-in-force defeated at Manassas.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"11\" data-entry-id=\"11\"><td data-label=\"Date\">July 21, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_Battle_of_Bull_Run\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">First Battle of Bull Run or First Manassas</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">Virginia</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Confederate</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC A</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">McDowell loses to J.E. Johnston, Beauregard ; Jackson named \"Stonewall\".</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"12\" data-entry-id=\"12\"><td data-label=\"Date\">August 10, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Wilson's_Creek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Wilson's Creek or Oak Hills</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">Missouri</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Confederate</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC A</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Union forces under Nathaniel Lyon and Samuel D. Sturgis lose to Confederates under Sterling Price and Benjamin McCulloch . Lyon is killed. First major battle west of the Mississippi.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"13\" data-entry-id=\"13\"><td data-label=\"Date\">August 26, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Kessler's_Cross_Lanes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Kessler's Cross Lanes</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">West Virginia (Virginia at the time) [ A ]</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Confederate</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC D</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Confederates under John B. Floyd surprise and defeat Union forces under Erastus B. Tyler .</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"14\" data-entry-id=\"14\"><td data-label=\"Date\">August 28 –29, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Hatteras_Inlet_Batteries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Hatteras Inlet Batteries</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">North Carolina</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Union</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC C</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Union forces capture two North Carolina forts.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"commentary\" data-placeholder=\"Add commentary\"></td><td data-label=\"Manual Supplement\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-field=\"supplement\" data-placeholder=\"Add links or supplementary notes\"></td></tr><tr data-paragraph=\"15\" data-entry-id=\"15\"><td data-label=\"Date\">September 2, 1861</td><td data-label=\"Battle\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Dry_Wood_Creek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" contenteditable=\"false\">Battle of Dry Wood Creek</a></td><td data-label=\"State\">Missouri</td><td data-label=\"Result\">Confederate</td><td data-label=\"Class\">CWSAC D</td><td data-label=\"Notes\">Union cavalry from Kansas defeated by Missouri State Guard.</td><td data-label=\"Commentary\" class=\"reader-editable-cell\